### Tracker with mixed manual + event run history
GET http://localhost:4107/pipeline/Pipelines?$filter=name eq 'Shipments'&$expand=runs($orderby=startTime desc;$top=10)

### Event-triggered runs only
GET http://localhost:4107/pipeline/PipelineRuns?$filter=name eq 'Shipments' and trigger eq 'event'&$orderby=startTime desc&$top=10

### Status convenience function
GET http://localhost:4107/pipeline/status(name='Shipments')
